# Phase 5 — Full Self-Improving Multi-Agent Architecture

## 1. Document Purpose

This document defines Phase 5 of the Self-Improving Agent POC.

Phase 5 extends the Phase 4 system from:

> **Select the best strategy**

to:

> **Coordinate multiple specialized agents, evaluate their work, learn from their performance, and improve future workflows.**

The objective is to demonstrate a complete local self-improving multi-agent architecture using Google ADK 2.

The system must remain:

* Local-first
* Modular
* Deterministic where possible
* Testable
* Observable
* Explainable
* Safe
* Compatible with the architecture created in Phases 1–4

---

