# 4. Phase 5 Goal

The system must support multiple specialized agents with clearly defined responsibilities.

The system MUST be able to:

1. Receive a user request.
2. Determine whether the task is simple or complex.
3. Create a plan for complex tasks.
4. Select appropriate agents.
5. Select appropriate strategies.
6. Retrieve relevant experiences and lessons.
7. Execute the task through specialized agents.
8. Evaluate intermediate and final results.
9. Retry or improve when appropriate.
10. Produce a final answer.
11. Record agent performance.
12. Record workflow performance.
13. Learn which agent/workflow combinations work better.
14. Use that knowledge for future tasks.

