---

# 25. Workflow Performance

The system should also track workflow performance.

Example:

```text
Workflow A:
Planner → Solver → Critic

Success:
82%

Workflow B:
Retrieval → Planner → Strategy → Solver → Critic

Success:
94%
```

The system can learn that Workflow B works better for complex architecture tasks.

---

# 26. Workflow Optimization

Build on Phase 4 strategy optimization.

Phase 4 learns:

```text
Which strategy works best?
```

Phase 5 learns:

```text
Which workflow + agents + strategy combination works best?
```

Example:

```text
Task Type:
architecture

Best Workflow:
Planner
→ Retrieval
→ Strategy
→ Solver
→ Critic

Best Strategy:
structured_analysis
```

This should be stored as learned workflow knowledge.

