# 53. Final POC Objective

At the end of Phase 5, the POC should demonstrate:

```text
Phase 1
I can solve a problem.

        ↓

Phase 2
I can remember previous problems.

        ↓

Phase 3
I can evaluate my work and learn lessons.

        ↓

Phase 4
I can learn which strategies work better.

        ↓

Phase 5
I can coordinate specialized agents,
evaluate their workflows,
learn what works better,
and use that knowledge on future tasks.
```

The final system is therefore a:

> **Local, memory-enabled, evaluated, strategy-aware, multi-agent, self-improving system.**

The self-improvement is controlled through persistent knowledge, evaluation, strategy optimization, workflow optimization, and agent performance learning rather than autonomous source-code modification.
